    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A sense of lethal grace follows the one who wields this axe, allowing for a fluid, two-handed mastery of the blade. Its jagged edge bites deep, leaving the victim's vision clouded in a veil of shadow. This weapon carries the sharp, biting legacy of a dancer's lethal art."
    }
